## 7. Final Selection Guide

| Goal | Preferred tool |
|---|---|
| Build a new list | List comprehension |
| Build a collection of distinct values | Set comprehension |
| Build key-value mappings | Dictionary comprehension |
| Access an element and its index | `enumerate()` |
| Pair values from multiple collections | `zip()` |
| Stop or return on the first match | Normal loop |
| Perform several actions per iteration | Normal loop |

